From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve original effects geometry with native four-byte data cells
Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3

Endian-convert represented scalars inside actual completed NL storage and use
real cached-address words for address-bearing cells. Original loader decisions,
raw chunk headers, authored25colour bytes and next-header alias remain intact.

